worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_quantity_constraints.js"
  ceiling 180
  rationale "The explicit quantity aggregate parser and inclusive-bound comparison. Native twin rust/src/quantity_constraint.rs owns the same source frame; tryArithmetic also delegates ordinary expressions to tryArithmeticExpression. Issue #1580 adds six lines reusing existing prime validation before loose arithmetic, matching solver_dispatch::handle_arithmetic in the default JavaScript runtime; no new primality algorithm or global allowance."
